[{"answer":"Are you just leaving the library now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I saw you get there at 8 am!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I've been there all day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/3.mp3"},{"answer":"What for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/4.mp3"},{"answer":"They hired a cute new librarian or something?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I wish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/6.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it's the presentation that I will give in Environmental Science the day after tomorrow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/7.mp3"},{"answer":"What's it about?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I heard you were really excited about the class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/9.mp3"},{"answer":"And Dr Schnee also calls you for the \"arcane\" questions, as he calls them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/10.mp3"},{"answer":"It's about environmental damage in the Yucatan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Excuse me, what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Or is that where?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Yucatan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/14.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a state in Southeast Mexico.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/15.mp3"},{"answer":"So what's happening there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Agriculture is having a really adverse impact on the environment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/17.mp3"},{"answer":"There are too many farmers doing too much farming.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/18.mp3"},{"answer":"It's really destroying the forests and ruining the soil.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Deforestation is a major problem there now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/20-2019-04-27-15-24-14.mp3"},{"answer":"How did you learn about this?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/21-2019-04-27-15-24-35.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't recall Dr Schnee saying anything about it in lecture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but my brother went there last month,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/23.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, to look at the old cities like the Mayan Indians built.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/24.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what first got me interested.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Your brother Tom?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/26.mp3"},{"answer":"No, Dick, Harry's twin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, he told me how few trees there were now and how much empty ground that grows almost nothing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/28.mp3"},{"answer":"He said the place looked more like the desert than jungle in some parts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/29.mp3"},{"answer":"It brought environmental damage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/30.mp3"},{"answer":"So I started looking for materials in the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Here, look at this magazine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/32.mp3"},{"answer":"What's in it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/33.mp3"},{"answer":"It's an old issue of \"National Geographic\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It includes interviews with tourists who've been there in the past few years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/35.mp3"},{"answer":"It's pretty bad. See the photos?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I see the photos, but one or two photos don't prove anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Then read what the article says. Right there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/38.mp3"},{"answer":"The first thing it points out is how soil samples show it's hard for anything to grow there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/39.mp3"},{"answer":"It says how an area of 21,000 square kilometres has lost most of its forest in the past ten years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/40.mp3"},{"answer":"See, there are graphs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/41.mp3"},{"answer":"As the number of farmers increases, the acres of forest have decreased.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/42.mp3"},{"answer":"It's an inverse relation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/43.mp3"},{"answer":"So how big is that state?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sorry, but I've never really learned the metric system.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/45.mp3"},{"answer":"It's bigger than the state of Massachusetts!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/46.mp3"},{"answer":"That's shocking!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/48.mp3"},{"answer":"There's lots of else.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Scientists say there's a \"growing area\" of about 10.5 square kilometres where nothing can grow at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It's like the beginning of a desert.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/52.mp3"},{"answer":"What Dr Schnee called \"desertification\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/53.mp3"},{"answer":"But, why can't anything grow there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I've never really studied soil chemistry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm just starting to look into that subject,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/56.mp3"},{"answer":"but my sister Marie is a geologist","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/57.mp3"},{"answer":"and she says the problem is that the soil has too much saline,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/58.mp3"},{"answer":"with no plants helping to adjust the chemistry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Apparently, that's a common problem with soil types throughout the areas with rainforest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Once you lose the plant cover, it's difficult to bring it back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Reforestation is almost impossible, even if the land is not being used for other purposes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/62-2019-04-27-15-38-56.mp3"},{"answer":"Wait a minute. What is \"saline\"?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/63-2019-04-27-15-38-40.mp3"},{"answer":"Saline is salt dissolved in water.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Scientists who've gone there have taken measurements.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/65.mp3"},{"answer":"They do this by gathering a sample of the soil and running a simple test that shows the ionisation of the solution.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/66.mp3"},{"answer":"The Geology Department in our own university has reviewed the soil at the site, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/67.mp3"},{"answer":"They're right. It looks pretty bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/68.mp3"},{"answer":"The level of salinity is going up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/69.mp3"},{"answer":"But the plants that would solve that problem can't be planted in soil like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/70.mp3"},{"answer":"There is a narrow spectrum of salinity in which the plants will grow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/71.mp3"},{"answer":"And once you pass the threshold, there is no way to put the problem right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly. It's possible that no one can do anything to stop the trend now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/73.mp3"},{"answer":"All because of human greed!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Wait a second.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/75.mp3"},{"answer":"How do you know these \"scientists\" can be trusted?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/76.mp3"},{"answer":"What kind of reputation do they have?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Are they reliable?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh they're definitely reliable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/79.mp3"},{"answer":"They include four members of the faculty from the Geology Department right here at MIT.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Here, study these photographs and check the damage yourself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/81.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what Dr Horst who wrote the book here did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/82.mp3"},{"answer":"He's newly appointed, but Dr Schnee says that he's brilliant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/83.mp3"},{"answer":"So, where are you going now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/84.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm headed over to the Geography Department to borrow a map for my presentation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/85.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, this whole problem could have been avoided!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/86.mp3"},{"answer":"The farmers there in the Yucatan...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh, Pete??","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/88.mp3"},{"answer":"What?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Go take a break! Leave some studying for the rest of us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-7-2019-03-25-11-24-53/90.mp3"}]
